Official Korean legal text
--------------------------

The frozen XML and normalized passages under fixtures/local-contract-decree/
contain versions of the Korean Presidential Decree "Enforcement Decree of the
Act on Contracts to Which a Local Government Is a Party" obtained from the
Korean Ministry of Government Legislation's National Law Information Center.

Source: Ministry of Government Legislation, National Law Information Center
        https://www.law.go.kr/
Open-data service: https://open.law.go.kr/
Retrieved: 2026-08-25

The snapshots are included on the basis that constitutions, statutes, treaties,
orders, ordinances, and regulations are not protected works under Article 7 of
the Korean Copyright Act, together with the source service's open-data policy.
Their inclusion does not imply endorsement by the Ministry. Source attribution
must be preserved, and the text must not be presented as altered official law.
SHA-256 values establish byte identity only; users must consult the official
source for legal authority and currentness.

The public sample API identifier recorded in fixture manifests is not a private
credential and is not proof of API-use approval. Anyone refreshing or extending
the fixtures must obtain any approval required by the source service and must
not commit personal API credentials.

